# Self-hosted on-device model assets — provisioned at build/deploy by
# `npm run provision:stt` (STT: transformers.js engine + ONNX Runtime wasm +
# Moonshine/Whisper weights) and `npm run provision:llm` (U5 listener: engine +
# the small instruct-model weights). Never committed: large binaries, and the
# no-egress design serves them same-origin from public/ → dist/. Absent → the
# adapters use their labelled stubs. The committed public/stt-engine.js and
# public/llm-engine.js wrappers are NOT under these paths. public/models/ is the
# shared weight tree for both.
public/stt/
public/llm/
public/models/
